{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.laundry",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "练习室的灯关了，洗衣房还亮着",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.laundry",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mikoto.laundry",
    "idolId": "mikoto",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……雨下得真大啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "练习结束的话，跟美琴说一声用车送她──",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（不过她大概不会看吧……直接过去更快。）",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……咦，美琴…………？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（真少见，是因为下雨提前收了吗……？）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（不过，美琴的话就算暴雨也会继续练吧…………）",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──大厅里没有，但钥匙好像还没还。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那就是还没回去。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………在的话，就只剩洗衣房了──……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──美琴……！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……制作人，怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，雨太大了，我想送你回去。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "去你用的练习室看了，人不在，我就在找你。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来在这里啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "这样啊？联络我一下就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……对了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我想美琴在练习的话，联络了也不会看，就直接来说了……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "发现练习室没人的时候就该联络的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………うん。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……一开始就联络的话，也不用绕这么多圈了。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "找了这么久吗？抱歉……不过，谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "美琴没有错……不过，真没想到会在这里。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "找花了不少时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过能赶在你回去之前找到，太好了……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "上次制作人说了之后，我也想勤着补水的。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……！这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "结果饮料洒到 T 恤上了。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "咦……！这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "家里的洗衣机现在不太好使，就想在这里洗。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "洗的这段时间，去了趟便利店。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……回来的时候突然下起雨了。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……那真是倒霉啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "うん，真的呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……也许是因为我做了和平常不一样的事，才下雨的。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，怎么会──……",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "或者，连天空也在说该补水了。像制作人一样。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "洗衣服大概还要三十分钟。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "等到那时候……也可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，当然没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "这样。那，再等一下──……",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──……呼啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么，美琴难得会困啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……うん，好像是。",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "洗衣机的声音，总觉得",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……很让人困。"
      }
    }
  },
